DESCRIPTION:Joe List  began his comedy career in Boston\, Massachusetts in
  2000 just weeks after graduating from high school. Since that time he has 
 been featured on The Tonight Show Starring Jimmy Fallon\, The Late Show wit
 h David Letterman\, as well as multiple appearances on Conan. He’s featur
 ed in Season 2 of The Netflix Series “The Stand Ups”. In 2015 List was 
 a finalist on NBC's Last Comic Standing and had his own Half Hour comedy sp
 ecial on Comedy Central. His albums 'So Far No Good' and 'Are You Mad at Me
 ?' can be heard regularly on Sirius Radio. List is also the co-host of his 
 own popular weekly podcast 'Tuesdays with Stories'. When not headlining com
 edy clubs all over North America\, List is a regular at the Comedy Cellar i
 n New York City.\n\nCouple's Package includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 
 food & beverage credit ($45 per person)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection\n\
 n**The Private Skybox Suite includes up to 10 tickets\, a $400 Food & Bever
 age voucher\, a personal server\, a private restroom\, and all gratuity cha
 rges.\n\nAny additional food and drink costs above $400 will be billed at t
 he end of the show. The guest count can not exceed 10 people. All club poli
 cies and safety guidelines will be enforced. Please note that the skybox is
  on the second floor of our showroom\, and is NOT wheelchair accessible.\nM
